## Throne

::bg{location="throne" time="night"}
<branch id="crownChoice" prompt="The crown is within reach.">
  <choice id="wear" label="Put it on">
    @ilo{mono}: It's cold. It's so cold. It fits.
    @narrator: Far above, the sea around the Gull's Mercy goes flat and bright, and stays that way.
    ::set{user.crowned = true}
    ::end{reason="crowned"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" label="Leave it where it is">
    @ilo{mono}: Not yet. Not while they're still waiting up there.
    @narrator: He swims back up through a palace that lets him go.
  </choice>
</branch>
